  ],
  "how": "for each of the 50 token pairs that have two or more pools: read getReserves()/token0() of every venue at one pinned block, price the WETH-in/WETH-out two-leg cycle over a log-spaced input grid, apply 0.997 per hop and the 0.9215 transfer-tax arrival only where the mid token's bytecode is the one TTAX clone M4 measured",
  "proves": "the analytic gross of every same-pair WETH round trip on this chain, in raw WETH units, next to the cost of the transaction that would realise it",
  "does_not_prove": "that any of it is executable: it is a reserve-math bound, not a simulation. A pool with no Swap in its history has no attested fee, and an unmeasured transfer behaviour can eat the whole number. Both are settled by execution, not by this file"
 },
