 "discarded_screens_note": "two earlier passes over the same 50 pairs reported grosses of 1e21 to 1e24 raw units. Both were wrong in the same way: the reversed leg took the non-mid reserve word, so leg two 'bought' a pool's whole WETH side without ever pricing the token it was selling. They are named here so the record shows the artefact was found and killed, not that the numbers were ever real"
